              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The purpose of this SPSS file is to present data collected from various questions related to drafting in high-speed sports from coaches and athletes. The dataset contains numerical data.\n\nThe scope of the dataset includes variables relevant to drafting awareness and if it is used during training and competition in competitive sports environments. It is intended for use in research on sports science, particularly focusing on drafting effects and athlete performance.\n\nThe nature of the dataset is quantitative, structured as numerical variables suitable for statistical analysis using SPSS."
                }
              }
            ]
